  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The two angels came to Sodom in the evening; and Lot was sitting in the gate of Sodom. When Lot saw them, he rose to meet them, and bowed himself with his face to the earth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said, “My lords, turn aside, I pray you, to your servant's house and spend the night, and wash your feet; then you may rise up early and go on your way.” They said, “No; we will spend the night in the street.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he urged them strongly; so they turned aside to him and entered his house; and he made them a feast, and baked unleavened bread, and they ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But before they lay down, the men of the city, the men of Sodom, both young and old, all the people to the last man, surrounded the house; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they called to Lot, “Where are the men who came to you tonight? Bring them out to us, that we may know them.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lot went out of the door to the men, shut the door after him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said, “I beg you, my brothers, do not act so wickedly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I have two daughters who have not known man; let me bring them out to you, and do to them as you please; only do nothing to these men, for they have come under the shelter of my roof.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they said, “Stand back!” And they said, “This fellow came to sojourn, and he would play the judge! Now we will deal worse with you than with them.” Then they pressed hard against the man Lot, and drew near to break the door. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the men put forth their hands and brought Lot into the house to them, and shut the door. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they struck with blindness the men who were at the door of the house, both small and great, so that they wearied themselves groping for the door.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the men said to Lot, “Have you any one else here? Sons-in-law, sons, daughters, or any one you have in the city, bring them out of the place; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for we are about to destroy this place, because the outcry against its people has become great before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has sent us to destroy it.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Lot went out and said to his sons-in-law, who were to marry his daughters, “Up, get out of this place; for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is about to destroy the city.” But he seemed to his sons-in-law to be jesting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When morning dawned, the angels urged Lot, saying, “Arise, take your wife and your two daughters who are here, lest you be consumed in the punishment of the city.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he lingered; so the men seized him and his wife and his two daughters by the hand, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " being merciful to him, and they brought him forth and set him outside the city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they had brought them forth, they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Flee for your life; do not look back or stop anywhere in the valley; flee to the hills, lest you be consumed.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Lot said to them, “Oh, no, my lords; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "behold, your servant has found favor in your sight, and you have shown me great kindness in saving my life; but I cannot flee to the hills, lest the disaster overtake me, and I die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, yonder city is near enough to flee to, and it is a little one. Let me escape there—is it not a little one?—and my life will be saved!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to him, “Behold, I grant you this favor also, that I will not overthrow the city of which you have spoken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make haste, escape there; for I can do nothing till you arrive there.” Therefore the name of the city was called Zoar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Little",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sun had risen on the earth when Lot came to Zoar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
